title AFTER MVP — CF-M14 — Separate target-authorized deployment
start
:CF-M14-S01\nInitiating actor\nActor separately requests\ndeployment of an identified\nartifact/revision to an intended\ntarget.;
if (CF-M14-S02\nExact target authority/approval,\nartifact/revision and\nrecovery/data conditions valid?) then (yes)
:CF-M14-S03\nSystem\nRecheck intended target and\nreviewed deployable artifact\ncontext;
if (CF-M14-S04\nConditions remain eligible at\nconsequential action?) then (yes)
:CF-M14-S05\nSystem\nAttempt only separately permitted\nintended target effects;
if (CF-M14-S06\nRequired target result actually\nconfirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M14-S07\nSystem\nReport confirmed scoped deployment\neffect; retain evidence;
stop
else (no)
if (CF-M14-S08\nBounded partial effects\nestablished?) then (yes)
:CF-M14-S09\nSystem\nReport actual partial effects;\nreview safe next action;
stop
else (no)
if (CF-M14-S10\nDefinite failed disposition\nestablished?) then (yes)
:CF-M14-S11\nSystem\nReport failure with known target\neffects; no assumed rollback;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M14-S12\nSystem\nTarget outcome unknown; reconcile\nbefore retry or recovery action;
stop
endif
endif
endif
else (no)
:CF-M14-S13\nSystem\nDeny target action; successful\nbuild/release alone is\ninsufficient;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M14-S14\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
